# Cloudflare Pages redirects for turonsf.com
# Reference: docs/Phase1_Deployment_Red_JEC_Audit.md F15.

# www → apex (audit F15 canonical)
# NOTE: www → apex redirect is best configured via Cloudflare Page Rules or
# a redirect rule on the zone, not via _redirects (which only runs after the
# Pages project receives the request). Document in Run Guide §5 instead.

# v3 endorsement hub (2026-10-14): the campaign pages were retired and every
# legacy route now lands on the same-language hub. 302 (not 301) so browsers
# and search engines do not cache the move permanently. The v2 site is
